###----------  SUBMITTED -> PENDING_APPROVAL ----------
POST {{base}}/sendForApproval
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "prID":"6cefaf36-5b22-4a24-b078-a8f5b719d059"
}
###----------  PENDING_APPROVAL -> APPROVED----------
POST {{base}}/approvePR
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "prID":"6cefaf36-5b22-4a24-b078-a8f5b719d059",
    "approver": "Procurement Manager"
}

###Create the PO
POST {{base}}/createPOFromPR
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prID": "6cefaf36-5b22-4a24-b078-a8f5b719d059"
}


###GET PO's
GET {{base}}/PurchaseOrders(856a8335-b499-4f5e-a679-ba8d391063db)

