###
### 1. Is the action registered? (should contain  Action Name="chat")
GET http://localhost:4004/procurement/$metadata

### 2. Ask the chatbot
POST http://localhost:4004/procurement/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "What needs attention today?" } ] }

### 3. Ask about a PR
POST http://localhost:4004/procurement/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "PRs awaiting approval" } ] }

### 4. Action proposal (use a PR in PENDING_APPROVAL)
POST http://localhost:4004/procurement/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "Approve PR-3001" } ] }
